6. Navigation Framework

Deep-space navigation requires independence from Earth infrastructure.

Proposed navigation components:
   •   Celestial navigation
   •   Star tracking systems
   •   Optical navigation
   •   Quantum inertial sensing (emerging technology)

Goals include long-duration drift minimization and autonomous correction capability.

