11. Discussion

Q-HISS proposes a transition from:

Command-driven spacecraft → Cognitive autonomous platforms

Benefits include:
   •   Reduced Earth dependence
   •   Adaptive mission capability
   •   Increased operational resilience
   •   Support for deep-space infrastructure expansion

However, challenges remain:
   •   Hardware reliability over multi-year missions
   •   Radiation resilience
   •   Safe human-AI interaction
   •   Energy sustainability

